  backbone is PaliGemma, a Gemma model. The weights are therefore a Gemma Model Derivative:
  Gemma is provided under and subject to the Gemma Terms of Use found at ai.google.dev/gemma/terms
  (a copy is included as LICENSE_GEMMA.txt). Use of the weights must follow the use restrictions in Section 3.2
  of those terms, including the Gemma Prohibited Use Policy (ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy).
